The GUI (lpk-gui.exe, Windows)
================================================================================

lpk-gui.exe links Microsoft's WebView2 loader (WebView2LoaderStatic.lib, from the
Microsoft.Web.WebView2 SDK, through the crate webview2-com-sys @@WEBVIEW2_COM_SYS_VERSION@@). Its licence requires
this notice. The loader is the one of the Microsoft.Web.WebView2 package @@WEBVIEW2_VERSION@@ (its x64 and arm64
libraries are byte-identical to the vendored ones, notices/webview2.toml), whose LICENSE.txt follows verbatim:

